        "Content": "Porch (7.87 x 7.81 ft) (2.40 x 2.38 m)\r\nwith Chinese slate floor.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall (10.17 x 10.50 ft) (3.10 x 3.20 m)\r\nwith wooden floor.\r\n\r\nSitting Room (14.11 x 25.26 ft) (4.30 x 7.70 m)\r\ninto bay window, recessed lights, coving, wooden floor, marble fireplace, fitted display cabinets, display shelving and door to outside.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Area (14.44 x 28.22 ft) (4.40 x 8.60 m)\r\nwith Chinese slate floor, recessed lights and double doors leading to;\r\n\r\nSun Room (14.83 x 16.08 ft) (4.52 x 4.90 m)\r\nwith ceramic tiled floor, recessed lights, wall lights and French doors leading to rear.\r\n\r\nKitchen (9.19 x 30.22 ft) (2.80 x 9.21 m)\r\nwith Chinese slate floor, recessed lights, cream built-in ground and eye level presses, granite worktops and splashback, ceramic sink, electric oven, electric hob, extractor, fridge/freezer, washing machine, 2 oven Aga with stone chimney breast surround.\r\n\r\nUtility Room (10.24 x 15.09 ft) (3.12 x 4.60 m)\r\nwith tiled floor, s.s. sink unit, fitted presses and recessed lights.\r\n\r\nTV Room (11.15 x 14.76 ft) (3.40 x 4.50 m)\r\nwooden floor, coving, recessed lights, cast iron fireplace.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom (14.11 x 15.09 ft) (4.30 x 4.60 m)\r\nwith oak floor, coving, recessed lights, walk-in wardrobe with wooden floor, shelving and hanging space.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (7.12 x 8.43 ft) (2.17 x 2.57 m)\r\npedestal w.h.b., bidet, w.c., corner electric shower, fully tiled floor and walls.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (16.08 x 17.81 ft) (4.90 x 5.43 m)\r\nwith wooden floor and range of built-in wardrobes, vanity area with drawers and presses.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\nw.c., pedestal w.h.b., bath with shower attachment, coving, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nShower Room (5.58 x 10.04 ft) (1.70 x 3.06 m)\r\ncorner pump shower, w.c., w.h.b., heated towel rail, fully tiled floor and walls.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (14.04 x 18.57 ft) (4.28 x 5.66 m)\r\nwith oak floor.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\nw.c., w.h.b., electric shower, fully tiled floor and walls.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (11.48 x 13.78 ft) (3.50 x 4.20 m)\r\nwith oak floor, range of built-in wardrobes, fitted vanity area with fitted drawers and presses.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 (12.14 x 12.47 ft) (3.70 x 3.80 m)\r\nwith oak floor, shelving and double built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nInclusions\r\nTBC"
